ains heterogeneous equalities.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Solvers.mergeTerms","kind":"def","line":2809,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Solvers.mergeTerms","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2809-L2868"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">structure</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.PendingSolverPropagations\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">PendingSolverPropagations</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.PendingSolverPropagations","kind":"structure","line":2806,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.PendingSolverPropagations","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2806-L2807"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.hasTermAtRoot\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">hasTermAtRoot</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension\">SolverExtension</a> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if the root of `e`s equivalence class is already attached to a term\nof the given solver.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.hasTermAtRoot","kind":"def","line":2785,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.hasTermAtRoot","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2785-L2794"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.getTerm\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">getTerm</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension\">SolverExtension</a> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ENode\">ENode</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `some t` if `t` is the solver term for `ext` associated with `e`.\nIf the equivalence class of `e` contains terms of different types, `t` is one of\nthe representatives of `ext`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.getTerm","kind":"def","line":2773,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.getTerm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2773-L2783"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.markTerm\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverExtension</span>.<span class=\"name\">markTerm</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">σ</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ext</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension\">SolverExtension</a> <span class=\"fn\">σ</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Registers `e` as a term of the solver `ext`. If the equivalence class of `e` already has a term\n`e'` of this solver with the same type, the solver learns `e = e'`. Otherwise, `e` becomes a\nrepresentative of the class, and if a class disequal to it has a term of this solver, the solver\nlearns that disequality. These callbacks are queued, not run here: `markTerm`\nis called from `internalize` hooks, where the callbacks must not internalize new terms yet.\nSee `ToProcessElement.solverEq` and `GoalState.internalizing`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.markTerm","kind":"def","line":2734,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverExtension.markTerm","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2734-L2771"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isSameSolverTerms\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">isSameSolverTerms</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms\">SolverTerms</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.isSameSolverTerms","kind":"def","line":2725,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.isSameSolverTerms","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L2725-L2726"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Solvers.newDiseq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Solvers</span>.<span class=\"name\">newDiseq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">