iv>","info":{"doc":"Returns the number of theorem instances generated so far.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getNumTheoremInstances","kind":"def","line":1672,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getNumTheoremInstances","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1672-L1674"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addNewRawFact\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">addNewRawFact</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">proof </span><span class=\"fn\">prop</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">generation</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">splitSource</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SplitSource\">SplitSource</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">ematchDiagSource</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.EMatchDiagSource\">EMatchDiagSource</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Adds a new fact `prop` with proof `proof` to the queue for preprocessing and the assertion.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.addNewRawFact","kind":"def","line":1662,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.addNewRawFact","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1662-L1670"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markTheoremInstance\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">markTheoremInstance</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">proof</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">assignment</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"A helper function used to mark a theorem instance found by the E-matching module.\nIt returns `true` if it is a new instance and `false` otherwise.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.markTheoremInstance","kind":"def","line":1651,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.markTheoremInstance","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1651-L1660"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.«doElemTrace_goal[_]__»\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">«doElemTrace_goal[_]__»</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.ParserDescr\">ParserDescr</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Macro similar to `trace[...]`, but it includes the trace message `trace[grind] \"working on <current goal>\"`\nif the tag has changed since the last trace message.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.«doElemTrace_goal[_]__»","kind":"def","line":1643,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.«doElemTrace_goal[_]__»","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1643-L1649"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.updateLastTag\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">updateLastTag</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.updateLastTag","kind":"def","line":1632,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.updateLastTag","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1632-L1637"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.registerInitialFVarAnchors\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">registerInitialFVarAnchors</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Assigns the anchors of the local variables in the initial local context of a goal. Variables are\ndistinguished by their name and their rank among the variables with the same base name\n(i.e., without macro scopes), e.g., a hidden `x✝` or a shadowed `x`. Variables that already have\nan anchor keep it, since goals may be created during a run (e.g., by `vcgen`).","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.registerInitialFVarAnchors","kind":"def","line":1615,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.registerInitialFVarAnchors","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1615-L1630"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.registerFVarAnchor\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">registerFVarAnchor</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fvarId</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Assigns the anchor of a local variable just introduced in the current goal.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.registerFVarAnchor","kind":"def","line":1607,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.registerFVarAnchor","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1607-L1613"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setIntroBase\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Goal</span>.<span class=\"name\">setIntroBase</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#UInt64\">UInt64</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Sets the provenance of the local variables introduced next in `goal`. See `GoalState.introBase`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setIntroBase","kind":"def","line":1601,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setIntroBase","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1601-L1605"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.hasPendingLocalDecls\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Goal</span>.<span class=\"name\">hasPendingLocalDecls</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns `true` if the goal has local declarations that have not yet been processed by `grind`.\n\nA local declaration is \"pending\" if its index is greater than or equal to `nextDeclIdx`.\nThis is used to determine whether `grind` needs to internalize new hypotheses.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.hasPendingLocalDecls","kind":"def","line":1591,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.hasPendingLocalDecls","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1591-L1599"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.setNextDeclToEnd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">setNextDeclToEnd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.setNextDeclToEnd","kind":"def","line":1587,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.setNextDeclToEnd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1587-L1589"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setNextDeclToEnd\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Goal</span>.<span class=\"name\">setNextDeclToEnd</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">g</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Sets `nextDeclIdx` to point past the last local declaration in the local context.\n\nThis marks all existing local declarations as already processed by `grind`. Use this when\ninitializing a goal whose hypotheses should not be processed or after internalizing all of them.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setNextDeclToEnd","kind":"def","line":1577,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal.setNextDeclToEnd","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1577-L1585"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHoistedDecls\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkHoistedDecls</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">decls</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HoistedDecls\">HoistedDecls</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e </span><span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Wraps `e : type` in `let` bindings for selected hoisted declarations. The proof may refer to\nhoisted free variables, directly or through metavariable assignments, even when those variables\nare absent from the current local context.\n\nDeclarations are ordered as `decls.front.reverse ++ decls.decls`. Using `getProofInfo`, selects\ndeclarations referenced by `e` and recursively by the values of selected declarations. Each value\nmay depend only on earlier declarations in this order. If the summary of `e` has `hasUnassigned`,\nkeeps all declarations; if the summary of a selected value has `hasUnassigned`, keeps all earlier\ndeclarations, since later assignments may introduce dependencies on them.\n\nDependency selection does not inspect `type` or declaration types. Declaration types are copied\nunchanged into the `let` bindings, so they must not refer to the hoisted free variables being bound.\nEvery selected declaration must have a value; otherwise, throws an internal error.\n\nThe body of the `let` bindings is an application of a fresh delayed-assigned metavariable whose\npending metavariable is assigned `e`. This postpones abstraction of the selected free variables\nin `e` until the delayed assignment is resolved, without instantiating `e` here.\nReturns `e` unchanged if no declarations are selected.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHoistedDecls","kind":"def","line":1520,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHoistedDecls","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1520-L1575"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getProofInfo\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getProofInfo</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ProofInfo\">ProofInfo</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns a `ProofInfo` summary of `e` by following metavariable assignments without constructing\nthe instantiated expression. Collects free variables and synthetic `sorry` occurrences, and\nreports whether the traversal encounters an unassigned metavariable at the current depth.\n\nFor an ordinary metavariable application `?m as`, combines the summary of `?m`'s assignment,\nif any, with the summaries of all arguments `as`, including arguments the assignment ignores.\nFor a delayed assignment `?d #[xs] := ?p`, summarizes `?p`'s assignment, removes `xs` from its\nfree variables, and combines the result with the summaries of all arguments to `?d`.\nThe local declarations of `xs` are not traversed, so dependencies in binder types that would\nremain after resolving a partially applied delayed assignment are not included.\n\nUnassigned metavariables contribute no free variables or synthetic `sorry` occurrences.\nOnly those at the current depth set `hasUnassigned`. During `grind`'s protected\n`withNewMCtxDepth` block, outer-depth metavariables cannot be assigned, and their local contexts\ncannot contain free variables introduced by `grind`. Their eventual assignments may change\nthe summary after the protected computation ends.\n\nSummaries of assigned metavariables with `hasUnassigned = false` are cached in `State.proofInfos`.\nA cached summary is reused only while the metavariable's assignment is the same expression.\nThis avoids repeatedly traversing shared assignments, such as proofs used by nested case splits.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getProofInfo","kind":"opaque","line":1455,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getProofInfo","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1455-L1518"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">partial def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.instantiateMVarsResolvingDelayed\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">instantiateMVarsResolvingDelayed</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Basic.html#Lean.Meta.MetaM\">MetaM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Similar to `instantiateMVars`, but also resolves the delayed assignments `?m #[xs] := ?pending`\ncreated inside the current `withNewMCtxDepth` block, which is entered by `grind` during its startup.\n`instantiateMVars` only resolves a delayed assignment when `?pending`'s assignment `val` is ground\n(no unassigned expression metavariables). This ground restriction exists because `val` may contain\nmetavariables that have `xs` in their scope. For example, if `xs = #[x]` and `val = ?n + x` where `x`\nis in the scope of `?n`, then `mkLambda` creates `fun x => ?n + x`. If `?n` is later assigned to\n`f x`, the term becomes ill-formed with a dangling free variable.\n\nThis scenario cannot occur here: in a `grind` proof, `val` only contains metavariables created\nbefore `withNewMCtxDepth`, and they cannot contain free variables created by `grind`, so the\nconversion is safe. Delayed assignments created before `withNewMCtxDepth` are left untouched,\nas they are meant to be resolved by other tactics.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.instantiateMVarsResolvingDelayed","kind":"opaque","line":1419,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.instantiateMVarsResolvingDelayed","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1419-L1444"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHoistedDecls\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getHoistedDecls</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HoistedDecls\">HoistedDecls</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the declarations hoisted to `goal`, see `withHoistedDecls`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getHoistedDecls","kind":"def","line":1415,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getHoistedDecls","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1415-L1417"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.withHoistedDecls\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">withHoistedDecls</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Executes `k`, which proves `goal` using case splits, while declarations can be hoisted to `goal`,\nsee `hoistDecl`. The subgoals of the split must include `goal` in their `goalStack`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.withHoistedDecls","kind":"def","line":1406,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.withHoistedDecls","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1406-L1413"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.setHoistedDeclValue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">setHoistedDeclValue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">depth </span><span class=\"fn\">idx</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">value</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Sets the value of the postponed declaration at index `idx` of `HoistedDecls.decls` in the goal of the\nenclosing case split at `depth`, see `reserveHoistedDecl`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.setHoistedDeclValue","kind":"def","line":1396,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.setHoistedDeclValue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1396-L1404"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.reserveHoistedDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">reserveHoistedDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">depth</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">key</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HoistKey\">HoistKey</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> (<a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Similar to `hoistDecl`, but postpones the value. Returns the free variable of a new declaration of type\n`type` hoisted to the goal of the enclosing case split at `depth`, and its index in `HoistedDecls.decls`.\nNo declaration may be registered for `key` yet (see `findHoistedDecl?`). The value must be provided with\n`setHoistedDeclValue` before the case split completes, and it may only use declarations created before\nthis one.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.reserveHoistedDecl","kind":"def","line":1378,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.reserveHoistedDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1378-L1394"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.hoistDecl\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">hoistDecl</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">depth</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">key</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HoistKey\">HoistKey</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">name</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">type</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">value</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">nondep</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.true\">true</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">front</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> := <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool.false\">false</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the free variable of the declaration `name : type := value` hoisted to the goal of the enclosing\ncase split at `depth`. `value` is only executed if no declaration has been registered for `key` yet,\nand it must be valid in that goal.\n\nAs with local declarations, hoisted declarations must be created in the right order: the value of a\ndeclaration may only use declarations created before it. If `front := true`, the declaration is\nadded before the existing ones, and its value may only use declarations of enclosing case splits.\nThis is useful for values that are known only after the declarations that use them are created,\ne.g., the variable context of a solver.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.hoistDecl","kind":"def","line":1352,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.hoistDecl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1352-L1376"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.findHoistedDecl?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">findHoistedDecl?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">depth</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">key</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.HoistKey\">HoistKey</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.FVarId\">FVarId</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the free variable of the declaration registered for `key` in the goal of the enclosing case\nsplit at `depth`, if any.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.findHoistedDecl?","kind":"def","line":1342,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.findHoistedDecl?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1342-L1350"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalAtDepth\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getGoalAtDepth</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">depth</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the goal at split depth `depth`: the goal of the enclosing case split at `depth`, or the current\ngoal if `depth` is its split depth.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalAtDepth","kind":"def","line":1330,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalAtDepth","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1330-L1340"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalStackDepth\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getGoalStackDepth</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns the number of enclosing case splits.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalStackDepth","kind":"def","line":1326,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getGoalStackDepth","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1326-L1328"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM.run'\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">GoalM</span>.<span class=\"name\">run'</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">goal</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM\">GoalM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Unit\">Unit</a></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Goal\">Goal</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM.run'","kind":"def","line":1323,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.GoalM.run'","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L1323-L1324"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=