=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ENodeMap","kind":"def","line":808,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.ENodeMap","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L808-L809"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverDiseq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToProcessElement</span>.<span class=\"name\">solverDiseq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">solverId</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lhs </span><span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement\">ToProcessElement</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Run the `newDiseq` callback of the solver `solverId`. See `solverEq`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverDiseq","kind":"ctor","line":804,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverDiseq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L804-L805"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToProcessElement</span>.<span class=\"name\">solverEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">solverId</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lhs </span><span class=\"fn\">rhs</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement\">ToProcessElement</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Run the `newEq` callback of the solver `solverId` on its terms `lhs` and `rhs`.\n`SolverExtension.markTerm` queues this instead of running the callback eagerly. `markTerm`\nruns inside the `internalize` hook of a solver, that is, while the enclosing applications of\nthe term being internalized may still have unvisited arguments. The callback may internalize\nnew terms containing such an application. See `GoalState.internalizing`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverEq","kind":"ctor","line":796,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.solverEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L796-L803"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.internalizeRhsAddEq\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToProcessElement</span>.<span class=\"name\">internalizeRhsAddEq</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">lhs </span><span class=\"fn\">rhs </span><span class=\"fn\">proof</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">generation</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement\">ToProcessElement</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Internalize only `rhs` (`lhs` must already be internalized), and then add `lhs = rhs`. Internalization\nqueues this when `rhs` may contain an application whose arguments are still being internalized.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.internalizeRhsAddEq","kind":"ctor","line":791,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.internalizeRhsAddEq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L791-L795"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.propagateUp\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">ToProcessElement</span>.<span class=\"name\">propagateUp</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement\">ToProcessElement</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Run the upward propagators of `e`. Internalization queues this instead of propagating\neagerly: a propagator may internalize terms, and must not do so while the arguments of an\nenclosing application are still being internalized.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.ToProcessElement.propagateUp","kind":"ctor","line":785,"name":