eta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L717-L717"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.next\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverTerms</span>.<span class=\"name\">next</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">solverId</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">rest</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms\">SolverTerms</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms\">SolverTerms</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.next","kind":"ctor","line":716,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.next","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L716-L716"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.nil\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverTerms</span>.<span class=\"name\">nil</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms\">SolverTerms</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.nil","kind":"ctor","line":715,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms.nil","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L715-L715"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">SolverTerms</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Each E-node may have \"solver terms\" attached to them.\nEach term is an element of the equivalence class that the\nsolver cares about. Each solver is responsible for marking the terms they care about.\nThe `grind` core propagates equalities and disequalities to the theory solvers\nusing these \"marked\" terms. The root of the equivalence class\ncontains a list of representatives sorted by solver id. Note that many E-nodes\ndo not have any solver terms attached to them.\n\nA solver has one representative per type in the equivalence class. A class contains\nterms of different types (e.g., `Fin n` and `Fin m`) only if it was merged via `HEq`\n(see `ENode.heqProofs`). Thus, the solvers are only notified about equalities and\ndisequalities between terms of the same type.\n\n\"Solver terms\" are referenced as \"theory variables\" in the SMT literature.\nThe SMT solver Z3 uses a similar representation.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms","kind":"inductive","line":697,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.SolverTerms","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L697-L717"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHCongrWithArity\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">mkHCongrWithArity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">numArgs</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/CongrTheorems.html#Lean.Meta.CongrTheorem\">CongrTheorem</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Creates a congruence theorem for a `f`-applications with `numArgs` arguments.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHCongrWithArity","kind":"def","line":681,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.mkHCongrWithArity","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L681-L694"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.abstractNestedProofs\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">abstractNestedProofs</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">e</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Expr.html#Lean.Expr\">Expr</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Abstracts nested proofs in `e`. This is a preprocessing step performed before internalization.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.abstractNestedProofs","kind":"def","line":675,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.abstractNestedProofs","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L675-L679"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getMaxGeneration\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getMaxGeneration</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Returns maximum term generation that is considered during ematching.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getMaxGeneration","kind":"def","line":671,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.getMaxGeneration","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L671-L673"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.getMethodsRef\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">getMethodsRef</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.GrindM\">GrindM</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.MethodsRef\">MethodsRef</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"",