ader\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.splitSource\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">splitSource</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.SplitSource\">SplitSource</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Current source of case-splits.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.splitSource","kind":"def","line":322,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.splitSource","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L322-L322"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.reportMVarIssue\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">reportMVarIssue</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.reportMVarIssue","kind":"def","line":320,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.reportMVarIssue","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L320-L320"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.cheapCases\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">cheapCases</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `cheapCases` is `true`, `grind` only applies `cases` to types that contain\nat most one minor premise.\nRecall that `grind` applies `cases` when introducing types tagged with `[grind cases eager]`,\nand at `Split.lean`\nRemark: We add this option to implement the `lookahead` feature, we don't want to create several subgoals\nwhen performing lookahead.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.cheapCases","kind":"def","line":313,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.cheapCases","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L313-L313"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchors\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">anchors</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`anchors := true` if anchors may be observed in this run: when generating tactic scripts,\nrestricting the search using `anchorRefs?`, or in interactive mode. Otherwise, `getAnchor`\nreturns `0` and local variable anchors are not assigned. It must not change during a run,\nsince local variable anchors are assigned when the variables are introduced.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchors","kind":"def","line":304,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchors","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L304-L304"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchorRefs?\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">anchorRefs?</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Option\">Option</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.AnchorRef\">AnchorRef</a>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `anchorRefs? := some anchorRefs`, then only local instances and case-splits in `anchorRefs`\nare considered.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchorRefs?","kind":"def","line":297,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.anchorRefs?","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L297-L297"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.activeSolvers\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">activeSolvers</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Ids of the solver extensions that `config` enables, see `SolverExtension.enabled`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.activeSolvers","kind":"def","line":292,"name":"Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.activeSolvers","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.lean#L292-L292"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context.identity\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Grind</span>.<span class=\"name\">Context</span>.<span class=\"name\">identity</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Tactic/Grind/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Grind.Context\">Context</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Name\">Name</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Name 